[Info]
Name	The Salt Lake
Description	A gold island in still water, reachable only over the causeways. Half turn symmetric. 2 players. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in ruins, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

